graph TD
  subgraph UI[React App]
    TS[TerminalSidebar]
    TV[TerminalView (xterm.js)]
    FE[FileExplorer]
    GP[GitPanel]
    APP[App orchestrator]
  end

  subgraph Tauri[Tauri (Rust)]
    CMD[Invoke Commands]
    EVT[Emit Events]
    PTY[terminal.rs (portable-pty)]
    FS[fs.rs]
    GIT[git.rs -> git CLI]
    AXUM[Axum HTTP server 127.0.0.1:6768]
  end

  U[User] -->|input| TS
  U -->|type| TV
  TS --> APP
  FE --> APP
  GP --> APP
  APP --> TV

  TV -->|invoke write_to_terminal/resize| CMD
  APP -->|invoke list_terminals/create/close/set_color| CMD
  APP -->|invoke list_directory/read_file| CMD
  APP -->|invoke git_*/diff| CMD

  CMD --> PTY
  CMD --> FS
  CMD --> GIT

  PTY -->|stdout/stderr chunks| EVT
  EVT -->|terminal-data| TV
  PTY -->|exit status| EVT
  EVT -->|terminal-exit| APP

  AXUM -->|POST /terminal/status {id|label,status,notify}| EVT
  EVT -->|external-terminal-status| APP

  GIT -->|spawns| git[(git binary)]
  FS -->|reads| Disk[(local disk)]
  PTY -->|spawns| Shell[(user shell)]
